Subject: [PATCH] Handle stub LLM capability without JSON parsing

The offline language-model stub advertises FUNCTION_INFO="stub", not a JSON
array. Return unsupported and release Configuration before parsing it.
Real capability arrays retain the original locale checks and error handling.

--- a/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/ui/policy/LLMPolicy.smali
+++ b/smali_classes15/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/ui/policy/LLMPolicy.smali
@@ -152,12 +152,25 @@
     const/4 v3, 0x0
 
     :try_start_0
-    new-instance v4, Lorg/json/JSONArray;
-
     invoke-virtual {v0}, Lcom/samsung/android/sdk/scs/ai/language/Configuration;->getOndeviceCapability()Ljava/lang/String;
 
     move-result-object v5
 
+    const-string v4, "stub"
+
+    invoke-virtual {v4, v5}, Ljava/lang/String;->equals(Ljava/lang/Object;)Z
+
+    move-result v4
+
+    if-eqz v4, :unica_parse_ondevice_capability
+
+    invoke-virtual {v0}, Lcom/samsung/android/sdk/scs/ai/language/Configuration;->release()V
+
+    return v3
+
+    :unica_parse_ondevice_capability
+    new-instance v4, Lorg/json/JSONArray;
+
     invoke-direct {v4, v5}, Lorg/json/JSONArray;-><init>(Ljava/lang/String;)V
 
     invoke-virtual {v4}, Lorg/json/JSONArray;->length()I
